  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lily and Tom play a game. They are in the living room. \"Point to your nose!\" says Tom. Lily points. \"Point to your head!\" Lily points to her head. \"Good!\" says Tom.",
      "\"Clap your hands!\" says Lily. Tom claps his hands. Tom has brown hair. \"Look at my face!\" \"I have two eyes.\" \"I have two ears.\" \"I have a mouth.\"",
      "Pip looks. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Lily has two arms. She has two legs. \"Four legs!\" says Tom. \"Pip has two ears.\" \"Where is his nose?\" asks Lily. \"He has a black nose.\" They are happy."
    ],
    "summary": "Lily and Tom play a body game in the living room. They name parts of the body, and Pip has two ears and four legs.",
